    "content": "Patriots' Day 2026 is on Monday, April 20, 2026. It is a state holiday in Massachusetts and Maine commemorating the Battles of Lexington and Concord, held on the third Monday of April. Events include the 130th Boston Marathon and the Lexington Battle Green reenactment on April 18, 2026.Key 2026 Details & ClosuresOfficial Holiday: Monday, April 20, 2026.Boston Marathon: Held on Monday, April 20, 2026 (\"Marathon Monday\").Reenactments: The Battle of Lexington reenactment occurs Saturday, April 18, 2026, at 5 AM on the Lexington Battle Green.Closed in MA: State, county, and municipal offices, public schools, and the RMV are closed.Open: Federal offices, post offices, banks, retail stores, and restaurants are generally open.Transportation: The MBTA will run on a regular weekday schedule, with some modifications for buses.Patriots' Day 2026 HighlightsLexington Parade: Scheduled to stream live on April 18, 2026.250th Anniversary: Concord is hosting special events marking the nation's 250th anniversary leading up to the 2026 celebrations.Alternative Parade: Note that a separate \"Patriots Day Parade\" takes place in Laguna Beach, CA, on March 14, 2026.",
